The '''Mysterious Package''' is a {{Rare}} item.

== Obtaining ==
The '''Mysterious Package''' can be obtained as a Minor Reward during [[Raffle of the Century]] event, or from the {{Item|Gift Bag of the Century}}.

== Usage ==
The player can throw a '''Mysterious Package''' into [[Lava]] next to a {{MobSprite|Plhlegblast}} in the {{Zone|Plhlegblast Pool}} to permanently gain {{Stat|Fishing Wisdom|+1}} and {{c|250k}}. The player must have also defeated {{MobSprite|Kuudra}}. The bonus can only be gained once per profile.

